<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Training details</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report our training dynamics during LoRA fine-tuning and the results of other ablation studies here.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F4" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.07356v1/training_metrics_horizontal.svg" id="A1.F4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/143;" width="548" height="143"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span><span id="A1.F4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Training statistics of KernelCoder on ConCuR.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Training ablations: size of dataset</h3>

<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
